接调用点修复（11个文件）\\n- 以下文件中 `this.$options.data()` 均改为 `this.$options.data.call(this)`\\n- `benefit/alert/index.vue`\\n- `company/staffManagement/components/certificatesDialog.vue`\\n- `company/staffManagement/personnelRecord/certificatesDialog.vue`\\n- `projectManagement/houseinfo/index.vue`\\n- 其余文件在来源会话中未完整列出，合计 11 个文件\\n\\n## 验证与归属\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏州市房地产监测V3\\n- 所属项目：苏州市房地产监测V3\\n- 来源会话：4c019747-1395-4046-9803-28a9f73b6493\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/account_type_dictvalue_mismatch.md\",\r\n      \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\r\n      \"frontmatter\": {},\r\n      \"body_sha256_16\": \"907919332af8ffc5\",\r\n      \"content\": \"# 账户类型因dictValue不匹配显示数字\\nOpenDetailDialog.vue 的 form.accountType 因字典 dictValue 与字段值不一致导致 DetailTemplate 的 tag 匹配失败回退显示数字。\\n\\n## 问题根因\\n- form.accountType 存 acctypeVal，原 /maintenance/acctype/list 接口字典 dictValue 为 acctypeId\\n- DetailTemplate 的 tag 匹配失败回退显示数字\\n\\n## 解决方案\\n- initDict() 中改用 getDicts('ACCOUNT_TYPE') 使 dictValue 与字段值一致\\n\\n## 验证与归属\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区公共收益\\n- 验证：src=园区公共收益/028.md\\n- 涉及文件：maintenance/accountOpen/owner/components/OpenDetailDialog.vue、maintenance/accountOpen/components/\n\n[...]\n\nnrelated sites.\\n- agent-browser logged into UAT; captcha recognized via magpie-vision (8/1 -> 8); navigated to Presale Fund Supervision -> Fund Deposit -> Other Payment add page.\\n- Form behavior: both 归集账户 (collection account) and 缴款网点 (payment outlet) disabled until 归集账户 selected.\\n- Blocker: project \\\"客测项目1123002\\\" had no 归集账户; handoff triggered while switching projects.\\n\\n## hop2 verification (2026-11-27)\\n- Candidate projects: 客测模拟小区001 and 文润雅筑 had no 归集账户; 文润雅筑123 (e1510) had 归集账户 \\\"文润雅苑监管账户002\\\" (account 3202118202611100012).\\n- Selecting that 归集账户 auto-filled 承办银行 中国农业银行 and enabled 缴款网点.\\n- Selecting branch 中国工商银行股份有限公司北京琉璃井支行 echoed correctly in the input instead of the placeholder \\\"点击选择缴