{"id": "msg_7f815d4656f948ed9d33edae90564dc7", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8b75e50dbc2caced", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\candidates.txt (Lines 721-852 of 852) ===\n[Notice: revision=c97336d6b3dc6af45354fa3008d2368a3d38a1fd732a45945dafedaf49b17369; bytes=57610.]\n721 | 苏住房C小程序因 ZsButton 默认 width:inherit 与 .long 写在 scoped 样式中，导致底部提交按钮过窄，已全局修复。\n722 | \n723 | ## 问题根因\n724 | - `ZsButton` 默认 `width: inherit`，在 `display:flex; align-items:center` 父容器中按钮收缩为文字宽度\n725 | - `.long` 写在组件 scoped 样式中，父组件传入的 `class=\"long\"` 在小程序端无法命中 scoped 规则，`width:100%` 不生效\n726 | \n727 | ## 修复内容\n728 | - `ZsButton.vue` 移除 `width: inherit`，新增 `block` 属性绑定 `zs-button--block` 类\n729 | - `ZsButton.vue` 将 `round` 属性绑定到 `zs-button--round` 类\n730 | - `uni.scss` 全局增加 `.zs-button.long`、`.zs-button--block`、`.btn-container > .zs-button:only-child`、`.submit-button-wrapper > .zs-button` 的 `width:100%` 覆盖规则\n731 | \n732 | ## 涉及文件\n733 | - 涉及文件：`register.vue`、`ZsButton.vue`、`uni.scss`、`bindProject.vue`\n734 | - 所属项目：苏住房C（zhi2-mobile-shimin）\n735 | - 来源会话ID：76068bd5-64a1-4185-a1a3-b190ca34998b\n736 | \n737 | ## 验证与归属\n738 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房C\n739 | \n740 | ===[41] viking://user/default/memories/entities/su_housing_c_tech/housecard_icon_fix.md sha=dac312e390fc862e===\n741 | # houseCard 定位图标布局修复\n742 | 苏住房C 的 houseCard 卡片底部地址栏定位图标在双列窄卡片中被压缩消失，已通过补充 flex-shrink:0 修复。\n743 | \n744 | ## 问题原因\n745 | - 地址栏为 flex 布局，新房 | 前缀设 flex-shrink: 0，但定位图标 .orientation 未设置\n746 | - 双列窄卡片里图标被压缩到 0 宽度，只显示「新房 | 高新区」而看不到图标\n747 | \n748 | ## 修复方式\n749 | - 在 houseCard.vue 中为 .orientation 补上 flex-shrink: 0（width: 9px; height: 10px; margin-right: 5px）\n750 | - 该组件用于苏找房页「推荐 / 新房 / 二手房」三个 Tab，修复后三列表均正常显示白色定位图标\n751 | \n752 | ## 涉及文件\n753 | - zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/components/commonNew/houseCard.vue\n754 | - zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/pages/index/components/Project_Suzhufang.vue\n755 | \n756 | ## 验证与归属\n757 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房C\n758 | - 来源会话ID：61371a3a-6a5f-4dcd-a98f-26224110a6a9\n759 | - 代码基线：none\n760 | \n761 | ===[42] viking://user/default/memories/entities/su_housing_c_tech/elevator_guide_fix.md sha=1936f8cd2f4b64f4===\n762 | # 增梯指引详情页服务器异常修复\n763 | 苏住房C(zhi2-mobile-shimin)「加装电梯 → 增梯指引」详情页报「服务器异常」，已修正跳转URL拼写与空值校验修复。\n764 | \n765 | ## 问题根因\n766 | - guideList.vue 跳转 URL 拼写错误：guideDetail??id= 多了一个问号\n767 | - guideDetail.vue 未对 options.id 做空值校验，请求了 /article/richText/undefined\n768 | \n769 | ## 修复内容\n770 | - guideList.vue：修正跳转 URL 为 guideDetail?id=${item.richTextId}\n771 | - guideDetail.vue：增加 ID 空值校验，若 options.id 为空提示「参数错误，请返回重试」，不再请求接口\n772 | \n773 | ## 验证与归属\n774 | - 构建验证：npm run build 成功，产物在 dist/；已确认列表页跳转 URL 为 guideDetail?id=...，详情页含「参数错误」校验\n775 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房C\n776 | - 涉及文件：src/pages_owner_extra/elevator/guideList.vue、src/pages_owner_extra/elevator/guideDetail.vue\n777 | - 所属项目：苏住房C（zhi2-mobile-shimin）；来源会话ID：396b7339-8e50-4545-8923-92c\n\n[...]\n\n> Fund Deposit -> Other Payment add page.\n817 | - Form behavior: both 归集账户 (collection account) and 缴款网点 (payment outlet) disabled until 归集账户 selected.\n818 | - Blocker: project \"客测项目1123002\" had no 归集账户; handoff triggered while switching projects.\n819 | \n820 | ## hop2 verification (2026-11-27)\n821 | - Candidate projects: 客测模拟小区001 and 文润雅筑 had no 归集账户; 文润雅筑123 (e1510) had 归集账户 \"文润雅苑监管账户002\" (account 3202118202611100012).\n822 | - Selecting that 归集账户 auto-filled 承办银行 中国农业银行 and enabled 缴款网点.\n823 | - Selecting branch 中国工商银行股份有限公司北京琉璃井支行 echoed correctly in the input instead of the placeholder \"点击选择缴款网点\" (core bug symptom fixed).\n824 | - Evidence screenshot C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Local/Temp/bug7080-branch-echo-20261127-163532.png was self-checked, presented and embedded in session.\n825 | - Use