{"id": "msg_76c69870a1af4580965f9f708d135633", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9ff8cb81ea870f9b", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\candidates.txt (Lines 176-195 of 852) ===\n[Notice: revision=c97336d6b3dc6af45354fa3008d2368a3d38a1fd732a45945dafedaf49b17369; bytes=57610.]\n176 | ===[11] viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/publicquery_back_query.md sha=85be06a7eb08a156===\n177 | # 公共查询备案返回保留query\n178 | 淮安物管公共查询小区详情从业委会/物管会备案返回时，需保留原详情页 query 以免页面空白的技术修复模式。\n179 | \n180 | ## 问题根因\n181 | - `goBack()` 统一写 `query: { type: 'back' }`，覆盖原 `formMode=view`，导致详情页不调用 `init()` 拉数据。\n182 | - `committeeTable` 中 `backUrl` 仅用 `this.$route.path`，未带 `?formMode=view`。\n183 | - `AppMain` 用 `:key=\"$route.fullPath\"`，query 变化会重建组件，必须返回时保留正确 query 才能重新加载。\n184 | \n185 | ## 修复方案\n186 | - `main.js` 的 `goBack()`：有 `backUrl` 时直接 `router.push(backUrl)`，保留完整路径与 query。\n187 | - `committeeTable.vue` 的 `backUrl` 改为携带完整 query（如 `this.$route.fullPath`）。\n188 | - 广告位备案等因未传 `backUrl`，返回不改写 query，原 `formMode=view` 仍在，故正常。\n189 | \n190 | ## 验证与归属\n191 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=淮安物管；来源会话：e6ed7dbc-1d6e-459f-aec6-1548de9852da\n192 | - 涉及文件：src/main.js、publicQuery/complex/components/committeeTable.vue、changeDetailMixin.js、publicQuery/complex/detail.vue\n193 | - 所属项目：淮安物管；代码基线：none\n194 | \n195 | ===[12] viking://user/default/memories/entities/su_housing_c_tech/notice_label_fix.md sha=19f8ddfa1ebe04bf===\n[Notice: 20 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; nextOffset=196; omitted=657; matched=852; failed=0.]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_76c69870a1af4580965f9f708d135633", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 1506, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T16:35:32.674Z", "peer_id": "git