{"id": "msg_78c81af358104582b18057784bb3dbf4", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8bd8c4b3d174680e", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\candidates.txt (Lines 526-550 of 852) ===\n[Notice: revision=c97336d6b3dc6af45354fa3008d2368a3d38a1fd732a45945dafedaf49b17369; bytes=57610.]\n526 | ## 验证与归属\n527 | - 验证证据：代码审查 [HIGH] 经纪端板块未按权限过滤：homeLayout.js:182-183 固定 BROKER_SECTION_CODES，仅有 secondHandHouseTrade 权限仍渲染完整住房租赁流程\n528 | - 涉及文件：zhi2-web-admin/src/views/home/config/homeLayout.js、zhi2-web-admin/src/views/home/mixins/homeDataMixin.js\n529 | - 所属项目：门户；代码基线：b84b4e7；来源会话ID：a55a779b-e7ae-4471-b38f-138e8f7b8d30\n530 | \n531 | ===[30] viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/miniprogram_h5_comm.md sha=ba5185dea22f23ed===\n532 | # 小程序与 H5 通信方案选型\n533 | i淮安公版项目中小程序与 H5（web-view）通信有多种可选方案，按实时性/稳定性有不同取舍。\n534 | \n535 | ## 可选方案\n536 | - URL 参数（启动参数）：小程序打开 web-view 时带参给 H5；最简单稳定，但仅初始化单向\n537 | - `wx.miniProgram.postMessage` + `web-view @message`：官方能力接入成本低，但时机触发非强实时、生命周期触发\n538 | - `wx.miniProgram.navigateBack` + 页面栈参数/全局状态：业务闭环稳定，但偏流程式不适持续双向\n539 | - 后端中转（推荐主链路）：H5 写后端、小程序轮询/刷新读状态；最稳可追踪可重试可审计、端间解耦，需接口与状态设计\n540 | - 轮询：实现快，但有延迟耗电耗流量，适合短期过渡\n541 | - WebSocket（经后端）：强实时双向体验最好，但服务端复杂度高（连接管理、重连、鉴权）\n542 | \n543 | ## 适用建议\n544 | - 若场景为“登录结果必须可靠到达”，建议主链路采用后端中转\n545 | \n546 | ## 验证与归属\n547 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=i淮安公版\n548 | - 涉及文件：src/pages/index/home.vue\n549 | - 所属项目：i淮安公版；来源会话：13c153e8-478a-41cb-b96b-542c5621b6d8；代码基线：none\n550 | \n[Notice: 25 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; nextOffset=551; omitted=302; matched=852; failed=0.]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_78c81af358104582b18057784bb3dbf4", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 1543, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "20