{"id": "msg_2a28a34742de46ddad5b032de822e9fc", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b45b97471316e027", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\candidates.txt (Lines 779-816 of 852) ===\n[Notice: revision=c97336d6b3dc6af45354fa3008d2368a3d38a1fd732a45945dafedaf49b17369; bytes=57610.]\n779 | ===[43] viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/el_input_ime_filter.md sha=8d384d7ca2a585b1===\n780 | # el-input IME 过滤失效\n781 | 在园区物管2.0 中，使用 @input.native 监听 el-input 搜索过滤会在中文输入法下失效，需改 @input 并直接使用事件参数。\n782 | \n783 | ## 现象\n784 | - 搜索/过滤输入框（如菜单图标选择 IconSelect.vue）英文输入可过滤，切中文输入法输入拼音基本搜不到。\n785 | \n786 | ## 根因\n787 | - @input.native 监听原生 DOM input 事件，IME 组字过程中原生事件多次触发但 v-model 尚未更新。\n788 | - 选字确认后 el-input 通过组件 input 事件更新 v-model，原生 input 不一定再触发，过滤函数读到关键词为空或仍是拼音。\n789 | - 英文逐字输入两者时机接近故偶发正常。\n790 | \n791 | ## 解决方案\n792 | - 去掉 .native，改用 @input 监听 el-input 组件事件。\n793 | - 过滤函数直接使用事件回调传入的关键词参数，不依赖可能滞后的 this.xxx 值。\n794 | - 凡是「输入触发过滤」场景均适用此规则。\n795 | \n796 | ## 验证与归属\n797 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区物管2.0\n798 | - 验证：会话 0f4d7bcd 用户报「菜单图标，用中文搜索不生效」，修复为 @input.native 改 @input 且 filterIcons 直接用事件参数，刷新后输入「三方」可正确过滤。\n799 | - 涉及文件：src/views/system/menu/IconSelect.vue。\n800 | - 所属项目：园区物管2.0；来源会话：0f4d7bcd-4f58-428d-a808-a25b8e090d3a；代码基线：7f13a8a38。\n801 | \n802 | ===[44] viking://user/default/memories/entities/zentao_bug/zentao_bug_7080.md sha=e9ad5919705c0017===\n803 | # ZenTao Bug 7080\n804 | ZenTao bug 7080 \"其他缴款-缴款网点选中后不回显\" (payment outlet does not echo after selection in the other-payment form) was fixed and closed under chain_id=bug7080-bankbranch-echo on 2026-11-27.\n805 | \n806 | ## Basic info and fix\n807 | - Ticket: ZenTao bug 7080 \"其他缴款-缴款网点选中后不回显\"; chain_id=bug7080-bankbranch-echo.\n808 | - Goal: real-device verify ec